grid the apparent diffusion magnitude is inflated by \code{sec(latitude)^2}, so
simulating in longitude and latitude would confound the recovery test with
the projection.

The process is the one in \link{jcrw_nll}:

\if{html}{\out{<div class="sourceCode">}}\preformatted{  v[t]  = v[t-1] + e[t]        e[t] ~ N(0, dt[t] * V)
  mu[t] = mu[t-1] + v[t]*dt[t]
}\if{html}{\out{</div>}}

with each individual's velocity innovation covariance built from its
magnitude, anisotropy and orientation:

\if{html}{\out{<div class="sourceCode">}}\preformatted{  V = exp(m) * expm(A)         A = [ u1   u2 ]
